548
00:43:51,720 --> 00:43:53,720
Go ahead. I'll be right there.

549
00:43:54,320 --> 00:43:56,279
It must be something about me.

550
00:43:56,280 --> 00:43:57,720
Let me look.

551
00:43:58,240 --> 00:44:00,000
