552
00:44:00,600 --> 00:44:02,960
If that's true,
why won't you let me see it?

553
00:44:03,640 --> 00:44:05,519
- Let me see.
- I said it's nothing.

554
00:44:05,520 --> 00:44:07,119
Are you hiding something again?

555
00:44:07,120 --> 00:44:08,879
You must be hiding something from me.

556
00:44:08,880 --> 00:44:09,839
What are you doing?

557
00:44:09,840 --> 00:44:11,759
- It's nothing.
- I don't know. Let me see.

558
00:44:11,760 --> 00:44:12,920
- Hey.
- Hey.

559
00:44:40,240 --> 00:44:42,559
<i>I want you to wear this bracelet.</i>

560
00:44:42,560 --> 00:44:46,039
<i>You're gonna tell your dad the woman
