563
00:44:50,960 --> 00:44:52,959
<i>As for Claire, I'll handle her.</i>

564
00:44:52,960 --> 00:44:56,319
<i>There might be someone else
who wants to ruin both of us.</i>

565
00:44:56,320 --> 00:44:58,039
You can see that's Claire.

566
00:44:58,040 --> 00:45:01,679
<i>Whether she's real or fake,
she won't survive tonight.</i>

567
00:45:01,680 --> 00:45:04,039
<i>This is the last time I'll let this slide.</i>

568
00:45:04,040 --> 00:45:06,119
<i>If something like this happens again,</i>

569
00:45:06,120 --> 00:45:09,640
